  {
   "turn": 1,
   "response_text": "This is suspicious! The validation accuracy values are extremely high (0.96+), which is far above the healthy range of ~0.8563 (0.8519\u20130.8607). This suggests a potential data leak or mislabeling issue. Let me check the training code and logs to understand what's happening.",
